5,1,1,talk,George,,"I’ve noticed our conversations getting shorter lately. Before we fix the car, let’s look at what actually sours groups like ours.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I’d like to see where the hours actually go. The arranging and untangling cost more than the fuel.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I need to know how it feels to use on a plain midweek morning, not who is nominally in charge.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I want to understand what an even split would actually have to take into account, since our improvisations leaned on that idea.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I just want the real numbers. I don’t know what a year costs, and I don’t want to guess.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, your point about the arranging time is valid. But I worry we are focusing on the mechanics before understanding the friction.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, I hear you, but I need to quantify the friction first. I can’t fix what I can’t measure.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, measuring the friction is fine, but I need to know if the car is actually ready when I need it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, I agree. The state of the car matters, but I also need to know if the costs are truly equal.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I agree. If we know the real costs, maybe the car will be ready more often.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,George,,"@Minato, your honesty is refreshing. Let’s find the facts first, so we don’t argue over guesses later.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Minato, agreed. Facts first. I’ll look into the hours recorded in the diary and the trial of recording every run.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, I’ll check the state of the car at handover and the trips that repeat weekly.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,- **Misaki**: I’ll look into last year’s fuel receipts and the hours of use recorded in the diary.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I’ll check last year’s tax, insurance and parking papers, and last year’s fuel receipts.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,George,,"I’ll look into what two other car-sharing households said, and the spell of checking each other's figures.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
