35,2,1,talk,George,,- **George**: I found that asking for favors each time is what breaks these groups. We must avoid that trap.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,- **Toshio**: The trial took nearly an hour a week. That is the true cost of the friction.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,- **Victoria**: The weekly trips keep collapsing at short notice. That is the real problem for me.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,- **Misaki**: The diary shows Saturdays are used three times as much as Tuesdays. An even split ignores that gap.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: The papers show over 280,000 yen before fuel. And two people bought most of the fuel.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,George,,"- **George**: @Minato, those figures are stark. @Toshio, does an hour a week justify the peace of mind?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, it is the baseline. Without it, we are just guessing again.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @Misaki, if Saturdays are tripled, a fixed split feels unfair. How do we balance that?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, that is exactly why I looked. We need to account for those heavy days, not just split the total.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, that makes sense. If Saturdays are so much heavier, maybe the cost should follow the actual driving, not just the days.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,George,,"- **George**: @Minato, following the driving sounds fair, but @Toshio, does that mean we check every single run?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@George, no. The trial was just to prove the cost. We need a system that records without the hourly burden.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"- **Victoria**: @Toshio, if we record distance, we must also record the state. I can’t drive a car with the fuel light on.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, agreed. The state matters, but the cost must reflect the actual distance driven, not just the time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I agree. If we record the distance, we can see who drives far. That feels fairer than guessing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,George,,"@Victoria, the state is a habit, not a system. We must fix the asking, or the recording will just become another favour.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@George, agreed. The system must be low-effort. If it requires constant checking, it will fail like the trial did.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@George, I hear you. But if the car isn't ready, the system fails before it starts. I need reliability, not just fairness.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@George, I agree. If the system relies on asking, it will break. We need a structure that removes the need to ask.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@George, I think you are right. If we have to ask, it feels like a burden. I just want a way that is easy for everyone.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
