60,3,1,talk,George,,- **George**: The options are here. We must pick one that stops the asking and the guessing.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"- **Toshio**: Option A. It records distance automatically, removing the hourly burden I measured.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
